# Counting a *collection* needs no new requirement kind: the record answers
# Collection.Mount as an ordinary requirement value.
!AchievementDefinition
displayName: Stablemaster
description: Own two mounts.
points: 10
tag: Achieved.Stablemaster
unlocks: [ collectibles/toy-tin-whistle ]
requires:
  - kind: Value
    subject: Collection.Mount
    comparison: AtLeast
    value: 2
